** SimpleTerminal **

The framebuffer console's escape-sequence handling follows the shape
of SimpleTerminal, and its 8x8 font is taken from SimpleTerminal's
embedded fonts. MIT/X Consortium License,
© 2024-2025 haoict, © 2009-2012 Aurélien APTEL,
© 2012 Roberto E. Vargas Caballero, © 2012 Christoph Lohmann,
© 2009 Anselm R Garbe — see /references/simpleterminal/LICENSE.

The following files contain derived portions from SimpleTerminal:
 - xv6/dma/kfbfont.h (the embedded 8x8 font, regenerated verbatim)
 - xv6/dma/kfbcon.c (VT subset and 16-color palette, reimplemented)
 - target/firmware/generated/images.h (the compiled kernel image)
